# NBA Combine Rookie Defensive Model

A single-page, mobile-friendly static web app that summarizes an exploratory NBA Draft Combine defensive prediction project.

## What the page includes

- A hero summary for the 2025 rookie DBPM model.
- Key model-fit cards for R², adjusted R², best signal, and complete 2026 predictions.
- A readable model formula and variable descriptions.
- A coefficient table with p-values and plain-English interpretations.
- A searchable 2026 predicted rookie DBPM leaderboard loaded from a local CSV.
- A top-10 / all-complete-predictions toggle.
- Caveats and data provenance.

